2e:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-16 border-t border-green-rule pt-8","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"eyebrow mb-3 text-jd-yellow","children":"Why it matters"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"max-w-[70ch] text-lg text-green-soft","children":"Every one of these pieces points at the same place: precision agriculture. A well planned route burns less fuel, a lane pattern without overlap avoids harvesting the same strip twice, and a fleet that coordinates on its own cuts the idle time between passes. What is a university simulation here is, out in the field, measurable operating margin."}]]}]
